WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Destarch a plant. Cover both sides of part of a leaf.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Expose the plant to sunlight.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Heat the leaf in water, then ethanol in a water bath.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Rinse and add iodine. Exposed areas turn blue-black.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
The covered strip stays brown. Light is needed for starch production.
